# Social posts

Read `social/SOCIAL-GUIDE.md` before creating or editing a social thread.

## Rules

- One folder per post: `social/<slug>/post.md` + `assets/`
- Use YAML frontmatter with a `thread` array (`text` + optional `image`)
- Keep `status: draft` until screenshots are in place and copy is proofread
- Never add social posts to `data/notes.json`, homepage nav, or sitemap
- Link to related notes via `related_note` slug only after the note is published
